    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Quasar – saxophone quartet renews its collaboration with the Escuela Superior de Música y Danza de Monterrey (ESMDM). This transcultural initiative creates a dialogue between the worlds of contemporary music and dance from Quebec and Mexico through an ambitious production."
