        "@value": "ENSEMBLE ÉCLAT - BROKEN SPACES | Le Vivier"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Broken Spaces is an immersive and uninterrupted concert that explores sonic and visual space in all its forms, combining electronic music and mixed music, with digital visuals created by Myriam Bleau. An intense sensory experience where multiple aesthetics intersect in an innovative stage setup."
      }
    ],
