    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Principal clarinet of the Orchestre Symphonique de Drummondville, Antonin Cuerrier is regularly invited to play with most of Quebec's orchestras, including the Orchestre Symphonique de Montréal and the Orchestre des Grands Ballets Canadiens. He is a member of the CASSIOPÉE ensemble and recently appeared as soloist with the Sinfonia de Lanaudière and the Orchestre de Drummondville.\r\n\r\nA graduate of the Conservatoire de Musique de Montréal, this clarinettist has more recently perfected his skills in Germany and Switzerland with Chen Halevi at the Hochschule für Musik Trossingen and..."
      }
    ],
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Person"
    ]
  },
