    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Jeanne-Sophie graduated from McGill University's Schulich School of Music in 2022 with a Graduate Performance Diploma in Andrew Wan's class. Previously, she obtained a Master's degree and a Bachelor's degree in performance from the same institution with Violaine Melançon and Felicia Moye. Before moving to Montreal, she studied at the Conservatoire de musique de Saguenay with Guylaine Grégoire and Nathalie Camus.&nbsp;\r\n\r\nAn active orchestral musician, she currently plays first violin with the Ottawa Symphony Orchestra and second violin with the Orchestre Symphonique du..."
      }
    ],
