      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "David Montreuil is a Montreal-born violist. His musical experience includes participation in the Aspen Music Festival and School, the Manchester Music Festival, the McGill International String Quartet Academy, the Casalmaggiore International Music Festival and the New York String Orchestra Seminar, where he was assistant violist. His career has led him to perfect his skills with such great musicians as the Pacifica Quartet, the Escher Quartet, James Dunham and Helen Callus. David is currently studying at McGill University's Schulich School of Music, where he is completing a Master's degree..."
