    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A chamber musician with a dynamic and unanimous musicality and an outstanding orchestral musician, Viviana graduated from the Conservatoire de musique de Montréal in the class of Carole Sirois. She was an intern at the National Arts Centre Orchestra Institute in Ottawa during the 2010-2011 season. Viviana performs in concert with the ECM+, the ARKEA ensemble, the Orchestre symphonique de l'Estuaire, the Opéra bouffe du Québec, the Radio-Ville-Marie choirs and the Chœurs Radio-Ville-Marie et les petits chanteurs du Mont-Royal. She has collaborated with the groups of Mario Pelchat, Marc..."
      }
