    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Pianist, she won first prize at the University of Music SOAI Osaka (Japan) and the Higher Diploma Execution of the Ecole Normale de Musique in Paris, France (Annie D ‘Arco class).\r\n\r\nGold Medal unanimously at the Conservatory of Bordeaux and the Medal honor of the city of Bordeaux and unanimously the first Medal of sight reading are given her.\r\n\r\nShe specialized with pianists Alain Motard, Vadim Sakharov, Francois – Rene Duchable, Jacques Rouvier….\r\n\r\nIn 1993, she was Professor of Piano University of Music in IOS (Osaka), and also at the University of Arts of Osaka (Japan).\r\n\r\nSince..."
      }
