    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "American soprano Anna Atkinson is completing her Master of Music in Opera and Voice at McGill University, studying under Dominique Labelle. Originally from Carmel, Indiana, she received a Bachelor of Music and a Bachelor of Music Education from Indiana University, where she worked with Timothy Noble. In the 2020-2021 Opera McGill season she can be seen as Ms. Jessel in Benjamin Britten’s The Turn of the Screw and Louisa in The Limit of the Sun, a new opera by Luna Pearl Woolf and Andrea Stolowitz being workshopped by Opera McGill. Atkinson was recently seen in Opera McGill’s production..."
      }
    ],
