        "@value": "As part of the Ukrainian composer Alla Zagaykevych's residency at Le Vivier. Presentation and first reading of a brand new work written for the NEM, with the participation of Alla Zagaykevych, under the musical direction of Lorraine Vaillancourt.\r\n"
      }
    ],
