    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Born in Québec, Canada, Linda Bouchard has been an active composer, orchestrator, conductor, and producer for over thirty-five years.\r\n\r\nWinner of both Composer of the Year from the Conseil Québecois de la Culture and the Joseph S. Stauffer Prize from the Canada Council for the Arts in 1999, Bouchard just received the Fleck Fellowship from The Banff Centre in fall 2015. Her honors in the United States include first prizes at the Princeton Composition Contest, the Indiana State Competition, and the National Association of Composers USA Contest and a Fromm Music Foundation Award from..."
      }
    ],
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Person"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "_:g12234460",
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://levivier.ca/en/artists/ensemble-triocular"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/sameAs": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.facebook.com/TRIOcular-109305620806337/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/identifier": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "https://levivier.ca/en/artists/ensemble-triocular"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Ensemble Triocular +"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The trio of Charlotte Hug, François Houle, and Linda Bouchard creates live immersive audio-visual performances that playfully oscillate between digital and analog spaces. Live performance, hand drawn Sound Icons by Charlotte Hug, and digital translation with Ocular Scores™ are processed interactively.\r\n\r\nLinda Bouchard, composer with Ocular Scores™ and live electronics\r\n\r\nFrançois Houle, clarinet and bass clarinet with live electronics\r\n\r\nCharlotte Hug, viola and voice with live electronics and Sound Icons.\r\n"
      }
    ],
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/PerformingGroup"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "_:g12234480",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/VideoObject"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/thumbnailUrl": [
      {
        "@id": "https://levivier.ca/sites/default/files/oembed_thumbnails/uk4PFRie79M8zk3cCXfItlwfg2NvS3kUhjBKhuNwSak.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/author": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g12234500"
      },
      {
        "@id": "_:g12234520"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "BANDE ANNONCE : TRIOCULAIRE + | LINDA BOUCHARD"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>// Dans le cadre de la saison automne 2022 du Vivier 27 NOV - 19h30 | Édifice Wilder - Espace bleu Laissez-vous transporter sur les chemins fascinants de la transposition graphique de la musique, grâce à trois grands noms de l’improvisation! Charlotte Hug (Zurich) François Houle (Vancouver) et Lori Freedman (Montréal) vous ouvrent les portes de Live Structures/Structures vivantes, projet de recherche de la compositrice Linda Bouchard, qui explore de façon ludique les différentes manières d’interpréter les données en notation musicale. Aux commandes de l’outil Ocular Scores, la compositrice repousse les frontières de l’expression tout en révélant le potentiel explosif et créatif des interprètes. •• INTERPRÈTES Lori Freedman, clarinette basse Charlotte Hug, voix et violon alto François Houle, clarinette Linda Bouchard, composition, traitement sonore et visuel •• PROGRAMME Linda bouchard : - Gathering (2020) - Création Canadienne - Drop (2018) - Murmure (2019) - Gaggle (2019) - Création Canadienne - Pandemonium - Création mondiale •• BANDE ANNONCE Huei Lin, réalisateur et monteur Sahara von Hattenberger, opérateur caméra Camille Jacques, opérateur caméra Frédéric LeBel, mixage audio. Une codiffusion de Linda Bouchard et du Vivier •• Plus d'infos : https://levivier.ca/fr/concert/saison-2022-23/trioluciare</p>\r\n"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/duration": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "PTH0M1S8"
      }
    ],
