        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Vivier InterUniversitaire (ViU)"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "By the musicians of the Vivier InterUniversitaire\r\n\r\nYon Chekhanovich : Gemmae\r\nYon Chekhanovich, sitar and electronic\r\n\r\nTomás Díaz Villegas : Impostores\r\nGwénaëlle Ratouit, clarinet\r\nFlavien Roger, basson\r\nVincent Rancourt, cor\r\nKimihiro Yasaka, piano\r\nHenri Colombat, direction\r\n\r\nJules Bastin-Fontaine : Diptyque\r\nJean-Christophe Melançon, piano\r\n\r\nSophie Kastner : Blue Wings\r\nAnna Atkinson, soprano\r\nRebecca Klassen-Wiebe, piano\r\n\r\nZhuosheng Jin : Three Images Inspired from Shuntarō Tanikawa\r\nKimihiro Yasaka, piano\r\n\r\nVéronique Girard : For if Dreams Die\r\nVéronique Girard, voice\r\nMaxime Daigneault, voice\r\n\r\nOlivier St-Pierre : Amor fati | Omaggio a Nietzsche\r\nFélicia Lévesque, flute\r\nHubert Tanguay-Labrosse, clarinet\r\nDaphné Bourbonnais, violin\r\nAudréanne Filion, cello\r\nOlivier St-Pierre, piano\r\nHenri Colombat, direction\r\n\r\nOmer Barash : Mit Groys Kheshek\r\nZachariah Reff, cello\r\n"
      }
    ],
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/PerformingGroup"
    ]
  },
