        "@value": "Magali began her university studies in violin at the University of Ottawa in the class of the acclaimed pedagogue Yehonatan Berick. Motivated by learning the violin and viola, she completed her studies in the studio of violinist Anne Robert at the Conservatoire de musique de Montréal where she undertook a Bachelor of Music and a Master of Music degree. She then continued her studies at the Conservatoire de Québec for a post-master's certificate in viola under the tutelage of Lambert Chen. She has gained valuable orchestral experience working under such renowned conductors as Yannick..."
