        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Týr Jami, cellist, producer, visual artist and singer, born in Vancouver, B.C, grew up studying cello at the Vancouver Academy of Music. She has toured North America, Europe and Australia playing her own songs and compositions, amd holds a Bachelors of Music from Concordia University in Cello Performance, and a DESS in Digital music from Université de Montreal. Týr is currently doing her masters in Composition and Sound Creation at U de M.\r\n"
