      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Originally from Milan - Italy, Mattia Berrini has been a student of Fulvio Luciani and Claude Richard, and holds a Doctor of Music degree from Université de Montréal.nDeeply fond of chamber music, he has performed on the two sides of the Atlantic Ocean in festivals and concert series such as QuartetFestWest and New Music Edmonton in Canada, Artemusica in Italy, Festival do Inverno de Rio in Brazil.\r\n\r\nMattia has freelanced for several orchestras in Europe, Canada and South America including United Europe Chamber Orchestra, Orchestra Barocca di Cremona, Orchestre Symphonique de Laval and..."
