        "@value": "Commissioned by SuperMusique, with support from the Canada Council for the Arts\r\n\r\nThe Unexpected Cyclist explores what happens and what doesn't happen, inside and outside a space bounded by a sky dome, trees and a lake.&nbsp;\r\n\r\nÉmilie Payeur\r\n&nbsp;\r\n"
