    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An Laurence 安媛 is a Tiohtià:ke/Montreal-based musician (guitar/voice) performing contemporary/experimental music, a curator, and a performance/multimedia artist whose works address memory and transnational identity. A daring performer, she collaborates with artists of various disciplines, and thrives in settings that stretch the limits of traditional music performance. An Laurence’s performance style ranges from contemporary classical to electronic music, as well as spoken and sung performance works. Her debut solo album “Almost Touching” released in May 2022 on people | places |..."
      }
    ],
