    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Brazilian interdisciplinary artist, Thais Montanari defended in 2022 her doctoral thesis \"Musical creation as a space for collective exchange and social debate\" in the research-creation program in Composition and Sound Creation, at the University of Montreal. As a researcher and creator, Montanari is interested in interdisciplinarity and collaboration between artists. Through her projects, she seeks to create a space-time where artists and the public can share ideas related to politics and sociology. Artistically, she is drawn to the use of images, sounds and everyday situations as well as..."
      }
