        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Evelynn Yan"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/givenName": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Evelynn"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/familyName": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Yan"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Evelynn Yan, originally from Vancouver Island, started her professional training while attending l’École de Danse Contemporaine de Montréal. Soon after graduation in 2021, Evelynn took part in two European tours as well as a premiere at the prestigious Théâtre Maisonneuve. Yan has participated in projects with choreographers such as Isabelle Van Grimde, Virginie Brunelle and Charles Brécard, notably for the Lugano Dance Project (2022), Danse Danse (2022) and the Festival Quartiers Danses (2021 2022). &nbsp;\r\n"
      }
    ],
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Person"
    ]
  },
  {
