        "@value": "Hommage à Claude Vivier | Le Vivier"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Under the direction of Lorraine Vaillancourt, the Nouvel Ensemble Moderne and soprano Myriam Leblanc will open the Semaine du Neuf devoted to the Quebec composer Claude Vivier. Vivier will play an important role in the programme with three of his works. The concert will be rounded off with a work by Marko Nikodijevic as a tribute to Claude Vivier."
      }
    ],
