        "@value": "FOLK NOIR | Le Vivier"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In FOLK NOIR, collectif9 dives into the creative mind of Montréal composer Nicole Lizée, accompanying you into a surrealistic world enveloped by machine-inspired glitch, haunting harmonies, and interplay between musical tradition and pop culture. With works composed in this millennium, including a new piece written for the ensemble, FOLK NOIR is full of imagery and narrative in an atmosphere to match the musical inspiration."
      }
    ],
