    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "With a master's degree in classical percussion from the Université de Montréal and a 5th cycle diploma in orchestral repertoire from the Conservatoire de Musique de Montréal, Léo Guiollot is very active as a freelancer with major classical, baroque and contemporary ensembles (Orchestre des Grands Ballets Canadiens, OM, SMCQ, Sixtrum, Paramirabo, Orchestres symphoniques de Sherbrooke, Trois-Rivières, Québec, Laval, Ensemble Caprice, etc.).&nbsp;\r\n\r\nHis keen interest in and aptitude for a variety of 'world' percussion traditions have also led him to travel and perfect his skills in..."
      }
