    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "“Jennifer Szeto […] continued to show why she is one of the most promising young collaborative pianists in Canada” (Scena Musicale).\r\n\r\nPraised for her “immense sweetness and precision that seemed to be flawless” (L’Opéra revue québécoise), “rock-solid rhythm… a great variety of color” (Bachtrack) and “amazing versatility” (Opera Ramblings), Montreal-based pianist Jennifer Szeto is carving out a dynamic path as a performer, coach, educator, and arts administrator.\r\n\r\nJennifer is a graduate of San Francisco Opera’s Adler Fellowship, the Merola Opera Program,..."
      }
