      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Born in China into a family of literature professors, Huizi Wang began her piano studies at the age of 4 and continued until she was 20, when she left China to pursue her literature studies in France.\r\n\r\nFour years later she began studying percussion at the Conservatoire national à rayonnement régional de Nice in the class of Régis Famelart. After completing a DEM (Diploma of Musical Studies) and a Bachelor’s degree in Musical Interpretation at the University of Nice-Sophia-Antipolis, Huizi Wang moved to Montreal where she completed a Master’s degree in percussion at the University..."
      }
    ],
