    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Andrea Young is a composer of acoustic and electroacoustic music, as well as a vocal performer of contemporary concert music. Initial studies in Vocal Performance and Composition at The University of Victoria, 2001, led to a Masters Degree of Music in Sonology from The Royal Conservatory, The Netherlands in 2007.\r\n\r\nCommissions and performances have involved Quatuor Bozzini, The Manitoba Chamber Orchestra, The Calgary Philharmonic Orchestra, The Chop Theatre, The Tomorrow Collective, Presentation House Gallery and Ensemble Sisyphe. Andrea Young has premiered new works in Vancouver, BC, at..."
      }
    ],
