    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Alex Samaras is a singing artist. His output as a performer and recording artist span every genre and style. Alex leads his own band, Tryal, and has released two records since 2017. Alex sings with the Queer Songbook Orchestra and has toured the EU/UK with Beverley Glenn Copeland.\r\n\r\nAlex is an active member in the Toronto theatre and dance community. He has premiered new operas and created roles in new musicals. In summer 2022 he will be performing Claude Vivier’s Musik für das Ende and Love Songs in Berlin and London. He has worked as a composer and vocal collaborator with..."
      }
