        "@value": "PROLIFÉRATION | Le Vivier"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "To close the Semaine du Neuf tribute to Claude Vivier, Paramirabo proposes an evening that explores the works of this composer who initiated his projects, including the eponymous work to the ensemble, Paramirabo. The program is completed with works by composers who are closely related to him, Karlheinz Stockhausen and Gilles Tremblay, teachers who greatly influenced him."
      }
    ],
