    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Paramirabo presents itself as a voice for the diffusion of today's music and for the promotion of emerging composers. As an instigator of innovative events, it allows young composers to perfect their brand in the Montreal new music scene and offers them a springboard to present them abroad."
