    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Ana Dall’Ara-Majek is a composer, sound artist and researcher living in Montréal (Québec). She is devoted to the study of how instrumental, electroacoustic and computational-thinking approaches interact in musical composition. In 2016, she obtained a doctorate in composition from the Université de Montréal, where she also taught a number of courses in the digital music section.\r\n\r\nHer works have been presented at a number of festivals, including: Sound in Space (USA), Multiphonies (France), L’Espace du son (Belgium), Sincrónic (Spain), Sound Travels (Canada), MANCA (France), NYCEMF..."
      }
