    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Born in 1989, and lives in Montréal.\r\n\r\nKevin Gironnay has been influenced by the teaching of Nicolas Bernier, Christine Groult, Horacio Vaggione, Denis Dufour, Jacopo Baboni Schilingi, Lorenzo Bianchi and Giacomo Platini.\r\n\r\nHe is the founder of the Ensemble ILÉA, and a member of the electroacoustic quartet QUADr, of the collective Unmapped, and he is a collaborative member of the research center CIRMMT.\r\n"
      }
