    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Louis-Michel Tougas is a Montréal-based composer and drummer. He obtained an undergraduate degree in composition at the Conservatoire de musique de Montréal, and then a scholarship from the Baden-Württemberg Foundation allowed him to pursue a master’s degree in composition and computer music at the Hochschule für Musik in Stuttgart, Germany. He then studied sound recording at McGill University and obtained a degree in music analysis at the Conservatoire de musique de Montréal. He is currently pursuing doctoral studies in composition at McGill University, where his research focuses on..."
      }
