    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Vergil Sharkya' is an Austrian-born composer, sound explorer and multimedia artist specialising in immersive experiences. He holds a master's degree in composition and music theory from the Universität für Musik und Darstellende Kunst in Vienna. He spent 15 years in Liverpool (UK), where he completed a doctorate in composition at Liverpool John Moores University, before joining the Montreal artistic community in 2010. His interests include the creation of immersive works, collaborative multimedia and mixed-media projects, as well as experimental and improvised music (musique..."
      }
