      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Ensemble Éclat, a group of fifteen up-and-coming Montréal musicians, is dedicated to programming immersive events, promoting the work of young composers, and advancing and integrating new technologies into the arts and music. It is supported by the Pôle Relève du Vivier, which assists emerging new music artists in supporting and circulating their artistic projects and works.\r\n"
