  {
    "@id": "_:g14634840",
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.supermusique.qc.ca/en/accueil"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/sameAs": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.supermusique.qc.ca/en/accueil"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/identifier": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "https://www.supermusique.qc.ca/en/accueil"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Productions SuperMusique (PSM)"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Founded in 1979, Productions SuperMusique is headed by Joane Hétu and Danielle Palardy Roger. This organization, a leader in its field, is solely devoted to “musique actuelle,” improvisation, and sonic experiments. Its operations focus on creating, producing, and programming concerts in Montréal, and on setting up international tours for ensembles such as Les Poules, Nous perçons les oreilles, and Ensemble SuperMusique. The company also presents music creation workshops for young audiences.\r\n\r\nMusique actuelle: unstructured rock, fragmented jazz, splintered songs, reinvented..."
      }
    ],
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/PerformingGroup"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "_:g14634940",
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://levivier.ca/en/le-vivier/repertoire/microfaune"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/datePublished": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2024"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "MicroFaune"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/identifier": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "https://levivier.ca/en/le-vivier/repertoire/microfaune"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/abstract": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\r\n«Le territoire, c’est le lieu où tout devient rythme, paysage mélodique, motifs et contrepoints, matière à expression. Le territoire crée et donc demande que l’on pense selon de nouveaux rapports.»\r\n\r\n— Vinciane Despret, 2019.\r\n\r\n\r\nLa composition MicroFaune s’inspire d’un enregistrement de terrain où j’ai exploré la musicographie d’une écoute partagée entre une population de rainettes et moi-même.\r\n\r\nDanse improbable, la vibration de mes pas circule à travers le sol mouillé.\r\n\r\nLe chant des rainettes cesse, toutes attendent, dans un «silence tremblant» puis..."
      }
    ],
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/MusicComposition"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "_:g14634980",
    "http://schema.org/url": [
