      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Created in 2012 by Alexander Vert, the Flashback Ensemble includes performers, composers, visual artists and researchers into digital music, all with the common goal of supporting and promoting today’s music and new technologies (gesture following, sound-image-gesture interaction, augmented instruments…).\r\n\r\nFundamentally focused on diverse expressions aimed at a wide audience, &nbsp;the group carries out various activities such as creation, distribution, research and development.\r\n\r\nIt also organises cultural mediation and training activities around the projects it undertakes, on..."
      }
    ],
