    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Ensemble Land of Kush"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Land Of Kush is a large orchestra assembled and led by composer and musician Sam Shalabi, widely recognized as one of Montreal's most unique and prolific musicians for over two decades. Shalabi consistently performs on electric guitar and oud, making regular appearances in numerous jazz and free improvisation ensembles, as a member of avant-garde rock groups, and leading the composition of various musical ensembles, both large and small.\r\n\r\nOver the years, Shalabi has released dozens of albums under his own name, with Shalabi Effect (on Alien8 Recordings), and as a member of The Dwarfs Of..."
      }
    ],
