        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "While Italian artists Giulio Colangelo and Vittorio Montalti transport themselves 20,000 years back to the caves of Lascaux through visual and auditory flashes, percussionist Charles Chiovato Rambaldo interprets a wild and completely uncontrollable biker straight out of Hollywood studios."
      }
