    "http://schema.org/identifier": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "https://www.stickandbow.com/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Stick&Bow"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Krystina Marcoux, percussions, et Juan Sebastian Delgado, violoncelle, se rencontrent lors d’un projet de création, Suspense pour 8 violoncelles et 4 percussions, composée par Luna Pearl Woolf en 2012. Ils sont tous deux charmés par la combinaison entre percussions et violoncelle mais aussi par l’écriture de cette compositrice. C’est pourquoi leur premier projet commun est une commande à la compositrice Woolf qu’ils auront la chance de travailler au Centre d’Art de Banff en 2014. Cette nouvelle pièce Mélange à trois est une création théâtrale de 40 minutes pour violon,..."
      }
    ],
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/PerformingGroup"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "_:g34119720",
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://levivier.ca/fr/le-vivier/repertoire/estatuas"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/datePublished": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2023"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Estatuas"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/identifier": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "https://levivier.ca/fr/le-vivier/repertoire/estatuas"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/abstract": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "\r\nI do not know the names of the statues, but I know that marble has frozen their lives, and that there is something striking from within.\" Esther Ramondelli, De heridas y luciérnagas\r\n\r\n\r\nWhat if we were all like statues locked inside marble, preserving our lives but depriving ourselves of the freedom to express? What if this marble took the name of fear, illness, or simply powerlessness? I tried to imagine what strikes us from the inside, what is alive and seeks a crack to escape. Thus, a fleeting melodic line is born from within. It awakens the most organic sounds, transforming into..."
      }
    ],
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/MusicComposition"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "_:g34119760",
